    34	
    35	The Silver settled again, shorter.
    36	
    37	The note under the boards changed. It did not stop. It went down, somehow, without getting quieter, as if a second plank had been laid under the first and the weight had gone through both. Cael felt it in his feet and did not understand it for a moment. Lira understood it at once. Her front foot came back off the boards as if they were hot.
    38	
    39	*Under*, he thought. *He's laid one under.*
