    71	She was moving before the steward's hand came down. Cael saw her weight go onto her front foot and stay there one count too long, the long lie the Stone had taught her in the first week of the recess, so that anyone watching for her burst would see it coming. The Silver saw it. Cael watched his knees begin their settle.
