    73	And watched Lira's feet change while the settle was still going down.
    74	
    75	It was the four-count. She had drilled it for two months on a painted floor, the last weeks of it under lamps, three lies and a truth, until Rooke said she did it in her sleep and the Current girl said she did it in hers too, across the dormitory, out loud. She lied with the front foot. She lied with the back. She lied with her shoulders, a half-turn east that pulled the Silver's eyes the same way. And on the fourth she went, her second burst, from the foot she did not care about, before his settle had reached the bottom.
    76	
