    24	
    25	He did not read the order until the hall had already cooled. By then it was on Bracken's board in two lines of the registrar's small square hand: *Received at a quarter past two, at the rail. Read entire, acknowledged, duplicate obtained and collated.* Under it Bracken had underlined *at the rail* twice. Karis had the duplicate, and passed it along the bench to Cael without a word.
