editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-471-- **Seln:** he produced the sheaf (and denies it); he has watched one sitting from the sightline seat; he reads three grades of officer. He has still never been told why Shadow was sealed.
