editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-581-- **Lira:** fit; trains under lamps since day 46; knocked down once by a lane (no injury). Left arm carried close from habit only.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-582-- **Brom, Karis, Seln, Ephram:** fit. The post porter's left shoulder strapped (a crate, day 46 or before); Seln does the morning sort.
