editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md:642:- (d) Daeva's statement is set aside at the **third** sitting, not the second, so that the second sitting's fifty-one minutes stays an exhibits morning and the statement's rhyme with Vastin lands in the same room as the ruling.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-643-- (e) The Seln circuit is walked on days 48 (post sort) and 49 (lodge), and the four queries, Hesk's letter, the inventory and Withrow's story all fall on day 49, so the inventory is named inside its sixth week. The source's "four days" between the queries and Hesk's letter became two hours.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-644-- (f) The wing-three bout is on the Fourth-day (sitting week).
