editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-73-| Quenna, Vell | Letters. Vell's (five short sentences, her mark and the circuit ledger's stamp): the archive session "stands whenever the road runs through Ardenmere again", offered and unclaimed. [B4-reconciled 2026-10-05] |
