editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-238-- **The Standard's arithmetic (flag: canon for M2–M9):**
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-239-  - Each of five judges gives three marks (execution, control, effect), each out of ten, and **ten is par**.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-240-  - For each axis the highest and lowest are struck and the middle three averaged; the three figures are added, so **par is thirty**.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-241-  - Bands: above 30 Gold; 28–30 Silver; 22–27 strong Iron to Silver-touched; 18–21 Iron; 12–17 Copper.
--
