editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-761-- **Public record:** Wind and the read remain the public suite. **Ember was spent on a public floor for the first time this book**, at the circle's two-contact rate, on the caravan captain; it was already on paper (the Greyvane exhibit; the wing vessel), and the inventory counts it as "a third shown at its documented rate" (owner flag 4).
