editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-763-- New technique, not a fragment: **timing and taxing Shield renewal** (watch the plant, find the oldest pane, ignite the pane coming up; the lost beat runs down the clock). **Riding a current along its bed** (read the back foot; burst with the push). Cael believes Shield "solved"; the narration never confirms it.
