editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-802-- (a) **Lira vs the builder is the semifinal, not the final**; the final is Lira vs Ephram. This is the only order in one draw that gives Lira first, Ephram second and Karis third (owner flag 1).
