editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-1004-  - A tunnel under the north tiers and a tune nobody can name.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-1005-  - Qualifying order: Halcenvane eleventh, and Cael placed last by the marshals' list.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-1006-  - Auremont's file reversed.
