editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-1444-- **Lira, Brom, Karis:** the council and the seal; the narrowing (Karis has marked it to come back to).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/STATE_LEDGER.md-1445-- **Seln:** has inferred that the bank opens tomorrow (the slip). He was not in the council and is never told about the seal. No reason is stated.
