editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-15.md-89-He said it in Withrow's office before he had sat down or been asked to, as soon as the counsel had given them the two sentences. She had come up the switchbacks at dusk in a hired chaise nobody had sent for and gone straight to the Chancellor's door, and Withrow had sent the porter's boy running.
