editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-16.md-144-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-16.md-145-She found it before the second bell. Cael was on the landing when she brought the volume in, open, and laid it in front of Karis with her finger under a sub-clause near the foot of the page.
