editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md-114-He did not throw that sheet away. He had taught that line to every junior he ever had.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md-115-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md-116-Then he took a slip of paper and wrote a question on it.
