editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md:118:*Minute of the 40th: evaluation seat, to be called. Refusal of the 44th: fully constituted. Who sat down in those five chairs in four days, without asking this office for the file?*
