editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md-120-He did not try to answer it. He pinned it to the denial, and closed the folder over both.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md-121-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-14.md-122----
