editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/EVENT-LIST.md-77-5. Karis writes it in her front matter. On the steps: the counsel to Karis about the price; Karis on what frightens her — he answered because the answer was obvious to him.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/EVENT-LIST.md-78-6. Evening: the house's counsel up the hill with them to work the produced record; stays in the guest room.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/EVENT-LIST.md-79-7. **Day 76, the gate.** Way in: the lodge-man doing a thing he has never done (shutting the lodge window on the road and coming out without his hat); the boy runs. Cael from the wall stair to the gatehouse gallery above the arch — a stretch of walk with a waist-high parapet behind the bell-frame. The court's geometry (exits: the arch, the lodge door, the covered walk's arch, the lane round the lecture range, the stable passage — the only one with no door). Four riders, no livery, good horses.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/EVENT-LIST.md:80:8. Withrow arrives with the counsel; follows the lodge's posted board (registry instruments: the registrar, the hour noted). She requires it read aloud. The order [P, verbatim body] with a six-word heading naming him (*In the matter of Caelen Hesk-ward.*); eighty-one words, Cael counts. Bracken's minute and forty seconds on the seal; genuine stock, registry format, issuing office unknown to him in thirteen years of this counter; "a facilities office, newly constituted"; constitution instrument; effective on presentation by an issuing authority.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/EVENT-LIST.md-81-   Interleaved: pass one (dismount, she stops three steps on — nothing), pass two (during Bracken: she's on the court's one level flag, over the capped well).
