editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r1.stdout.log-1053-- **Lira:** the Silver's advice ("go on your fifth"); the panel's figure under a hall's seal; the town's caution explained (licences). She has not said aloud that the road east has no Silver card.
