editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r1.stdout.log-3934-    39	Then he said, in the counter voice, the flattest one, "This is genuine registry stock. The seal is a registry-format seal. I do not recognize the issuing office, and I have processed instruments from every issuing office in this district and the three adjacent for thirty years."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r1.stdout.log-3935-    40	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r1.stdout.log:3936:    41	"The office is a facilities office," said the rider, without inflection. "Newly constituted for the proceedings' support."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r1.stdout.log-3937-    42	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r1.stdout.log:3938:    43	"Then it will have a constitution instrument on file at the district seat," said Bracken, "and the academy will verify it there before anything else happens."
