editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/pre-repair/chapter-27.md:273:He looked instead at the order, as Seln was looking at it. *Effective on presentation.* *Transport and escort provided.* *Given under the Compact's hand.* At Norhold, in a lent room of the timekeepers' office with forty clocks ticking on its walls, the Archmarshal had told him that the people who wanted this to stop would not go on using official channels much longer. This morning something that was neither one thing nor the other had come up the bluff road in plain grey, politely, with genuine paper in its hand, and knocked. It had measured the door and gone away. There were other gates on the continent, and most of them had no Withrow in them.
