editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-002/review-cold-prompt.md-1189-The first came on the thirty-first day, to Bracken's counter, in the district seat's grey stock with the district's own small seal. Bracken did not send for Brom. He carried it across to the refectory himself at the noon meal, for the second time that year, and this time he did not lay it on the table. He stood at the end of the middle table and read it aloud, all of it, which he had never done with anybody's paper in that room.
