editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r2.stdout.log-3023-    53	The proceedings' schedule was the schedule; the seat had set it; no pre-evaluation assessment appeared anywhere in it. No facility transfer was contemplated by any instrument the academy had been served. The order's issuing authority was unidentifiable to the registrar of a chartered institution, which was itself a procedural defect requiring verification before compliance. And the enrollee was an enrollee in good standing of a respondent institution in active proceedings, whose production the code governed precisely, and the code's word was the only word that moved him.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r2.stdout.log-3024-    54	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/recheck-r2.stdout.log:3025:    55	"The academy declines the order pending verification," she finished. "You may wait while we verify, or you may return with the constitution instrument. The gate will log either."
