editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/source-tracking.stdout.log-2138-    52	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/source-tracking.stdout.log-2139-    53	The proceedings' schedule was the schedule; the seat had set it; no pre-evaluation assessment appeared anywhere in it. No facility transfer was contemplated by any instrument the academy had been served. The order's issuing authority was unidentifiable to the registrar of a chartered institution, which was itself a procedural defect requiring verification before compliance. And the enrollee was an enrollee in good standing of a respondent institution in active proceedings, whose production the code governed precisely, and the code's word was the only word that moved him.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/source-tracking.stdout.log-2140-    54	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/source-tracking.stdout.log:2141:    55	"The academy declines the order pending verification," she finished. "You may wait while we verify, or you may return with the constitution instrument. The gate will log either."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/source-tracking.stdout.log-2142-    56	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-004/source-tracking.stdout.log-2143-    57	The lead rider took that without any change of face at all, and then he offered the morning's one piece of pressure, and he offered it in the mildest form available, which was the form that told Cael more than anything else in the yard.
