editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-cold.stdout.log-1252-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-cold.stdout.log-1253-He stood at the window with it a long time. The porter had gone in. The court was empty. He read it again, and a third time, and on the third pass something shifted, the way the figure in a puzzle-picture shifts and will not shift back. Until then he had been hearing an answer. Now he was looking at workmanship. And he knew the writer's school, because it was his own.
