editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-cold.stdout.log-2645-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/review-cold.stdout.log-2646-Ilsev closed the fold of paper over the shavings, put it in her coat pocket, and bent her head toward the platform to the depth the registry taught, no more and no less. Then she opened the topmost file and began to read it with the patience of somebody who has read it three times and intends one more before she is asked a single question.
