editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-924-  contemplated by the schedule.* and the tab *Pending a proceeding worth sending it to.* (5)
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-925-- "They benched their best instrument because he measures true." (5)
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-926-- "None, Advocate. The petition doesn't turn on evidence. It turns on discretion." (10)
