editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-2761-   120	
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log:2762:   121	"Two sentences." She gave them in the voice she kept for exact quotation, every word set down separately like a coin on a counter. "*The proceedings' evaluation seat is fully constituted. Supplementary findings are not contemplated by the schedule.*"
