editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-2764-   123	"Once more," said Withrow.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/source-tracking.stdout.log-2765-   124	
