editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r1.stdout.log-9373-122:- **Hesk:** the surveyor's level made for a man's father thirty years ago, set back a hair wrong at the son's request; brass a third dearer; the widow across the lane's dog. The shop's title is one district sheet in a tin box under the long bench with the receipts. As a small boy Cael slept in the shavings under the bench.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r1.stdout.log-9374-123:- **Honest floor (flag):** under low lamps the lane's running dust throws a shadow on the boards, so the lane can be seen as a moving dark band; Lira reads it and bursts along its edge. No new figure (the lane's bill stays ten counts).
