editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/state/movement-003/recheck-r1.stdout.log-10696-   153	That told him more than the sentences did. A schedule drawn to find something out would have wanted him in it. This one had been drawn by somebody who already knew what it would find, and had left no chair for anyone who might find something else.
