+
+`chapter-27.md:79–81` makes the horse's failure to take the coming weight the observable tell; `chapter-27.md:147–153` lets Seln infer “the best they had to spare this morning” from that fact. That satisfies the new canon. It does not by itself clear `27:71`, because the source's advance tell → no tell → trained out chain still survives through the horse.
